rection:column;gap:10px\"><div style=\"font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40\">Course format</div><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652\">Online, self-paced, live instruction, video, text and printed materials, shown once confirmed by the provider or our review.</p></div>\n        <div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:16px;padding:28px 30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\"><div style=\"font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40\">Support and access</div><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652\">Support channels, mobile access and similar features, displayed only when verified.</p></div>\n        <div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:16px;padding:28px 30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\"><div style=\"font:800 22px Manrope,sans-serif;color:#0B2E40\">Website link</div><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F4652\">A direct link to the provider’s site. You enroll with the school, not with us.</p></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background:#fff;padding:72px 56px\">\n    <div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:56px;align-items:start\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\"><div style=\"font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330\">Ordering</div><h2 style=\"margin:0;font:300 52px/1.1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em\">No rankings. <span style=\"font-weight:800\">You choose the sort.</span></h2><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652;text-wrap:pretty\">Listings default to alphabetical order. You can sort by published price or filter by course type and verified features. No provider can pay to move up, and we publish no editorial score.</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652;text-wrap:pretty\">If we later add ratings or reviews, this page will describe exactly how they are gathered before they appear on the site.</p></div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px\"><div style=\"font:700 17px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E9330\">Checking</div><h2 style=\"margin:0;font:300 52px/1.1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.02em\">What we check, <span style=\"font-weight:800\">and when</span></h2><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652;text-wrap:pretty\">Prices, offers and approval status are reviewed against provider websites and the CTEC registry on each data review. The date of the most recent completed review is shown on the homepage and on this page: <strong style=\"color:#0B2E40\">September 6, 2026</strong>.</p><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.65;color:#2F4652;text-wrap:pretty\">Providers can verify or correct their own listing at no charge through <a href=\"/provider-application/\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">Verify your profile</a> or <a href=\"/provider-rights/#correction\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">Request a correction</a>.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"background:#F4F6F7;padding:56px 56px 72px\"><div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;background:#fff;border:1px solid #D7DFE2;border-radius:16px;padding:22px 28px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.6;color:#5A6E78\">Tax Course Finder is an independent comparison website and is not affiliated with CTEC or with any listed provider. Confirm course details and approval on the provider’s site and at <a href=\"https://ctec.org/taxpreparers/find-education-provider/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#7E9330;font-weight:700\">CTEC.org</a> before enrolling.</div></div>\n  \n</div>\n  \n"
